# ncm-core protocol layer.
# The bundled output (js/ncm-protocol.js) IS committed on purpose, so a plain
# `cargo build` never needs Node. These two are not:
#   .cache/     the unpacked upstream tarball, refetched by the build script
#   shim/generated-data.js   static assets inlined into the bundle at build time
src-tauri/crates/ncm-core/.cache/
src-tauri/crates/ncm-core/js/shim/generated-data.js